{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41623","headline":"怀仙吟二首 一 · 陈陶","name":"怀仙吟二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹陵五牙客，昨日罗浮归。\n赤斧寻不得，烟霞空满衣。\n试於华阳问，果遇三茅知。\n采药向十洲，同行牧羊儿。\n十洲隔八海，浩渺不可期。\n留空双白鹤，巢在长松枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}